OL,3,AParaguay's former president charged
OL,4,Aafter bank collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors in Paraguay have charged
OL,7,Fformer president Santiago Pena over his
OL,8,Falleged role in a banking scandal that
OL,9,Fled to his impeachment.
OL,11,FHe has been accused of breach of trust
OL,12,Fand administration for personal gain.
OL,14,FPena, who denies any wrongdoing, was
OL,15,Fforced from office after a bank
OL,16,Fcollapse triggered a crisis that left
OL,17,Fmore than half of the country's
OL,18,Fpopulation without access to their
OL,19,Faccounts.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
