OL,3,AParaguay's former president charged
OL,4,Aafter bank collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe was arrested on Friday minutes after
OL,7,Flawmakers, including from his own
OL,8,Fparty, unanimously voted to remove him
OL,9,Ffrom office following the collapse of
OL,10,FUeno Bank, which has links to his
OL,11,Fprivate business interests.
